{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011jB8dHdBa7ECt7hUvvBCUd","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 agent_progress_probe 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (53 个)\\n\\n- **openhands-fewshot-probe**: DONE (success) — \\n- **train-without-ob**: DONE (success) — \\n- **baseline-llm-judge**: DONE (success) — \\n- **data-volume-control**: DONE (success) — \\n- **encoder-ablation-bge-m3**: DONE (success) — \\n- **encoder-ablation-e5-large**: DONE (success) — \\n- **outcome-bp-sensitivity**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **outcome-bp-3seed**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **cross-agent-eval**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **baseline_flyingsquid**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **probe-multiseed**: DONE (success) — \\n- **baseline-meanpool-lr**: DONE (success) — \\n- **probe-002**: DONE (success) — \\n- **probe_001**: DONE (success) — \\n- **emb_001**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-14\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n（无）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **f1-stag-analysis** (success): Analysis: F1_stag per-class breakdown across 5 dimensions (confidence, trajectory length, LF consistency, outcome, error subtypes) on SWE test set.\\n- **f1-stag-traj-length** (success): Analysis: F1_stag breakdown by trajectory length tercile. Tests whether probe performance varies with trajectory duration.\\n- **encoder-ablation-probe-bgem3** (success): —\\n  [bgem3_multiseed_test_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/agent_progress_probe/artifacts/encoder-ablation-probe-bgem3/data/bgem3_multiseed_test_results.txt)\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 32 / 负向 9 / 失败 1 / 共 52\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nbjb2-23165: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1\\n\\n## 告警\\n- encoder-ablation: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- outcome-bp-3seed-s42: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- encoder-ablation-probe: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- encoder-ablation-probe-e5: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- encoder-ablation-probe-bge-m3: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- ablation-lf-holdout: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- data-scaling: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- tw